| `docs-structure` | globs: docs/**/*.md | 문서 구조·인덱스 갱신·ADR |
| `db-schema-overview` | globs: models/schemas/crud/functions | DB 테이블·UID·VIEW |
| `router-patterns` | globs: routers/**/*.py | 라우터 기본 구조·로거 |
| `frontend-backend-gap` | globs: routers/**/*.py | FE/BE 갭·Phase 1~5 |
| `jira-integration` | globs: routers+docs | Jira MCP·ISRN 티켓 구조 |
